Spec: Stage

ID:
  @DO

Purpose:
  Deployment and DevOps validation.

Entry:
  SC passed
  deployment plan ready
  applicable skills loaded

Must:
  build artifact
  run deployment
  verify infrastructure
  check monitoring
  validate rollback plan

Exit:
  deployment successful
  health checks pass
  monitoring active
  rollback tested

OnFail:
  classify failure
    infrastructure -> DO
    code defect -> owner stage
  << DO

Next:
  VR

Review:
  @DO/deployment
  @DO/monitoring

Risk:
  R2

Skills:
  @devops/docker
  @devops/ci-cd
  @devops/deployment
  @devops/rollback

State: +
  
